167
00:25:01.537 --> 00:25:03.144
Who is he?

168
00:25:03.480 --> 00:25:09.208
The curious always finds complexity.
Please, drink.

169
00:25:09.233 --> 00:25:10.933
Okay.

170
00:25:22.920 --> 00:25:27.933
Shu, this might sound
