171
00:25:28.800 --> 00:25:32.984
I saw the way you fought yesterday.
It was incredible.

172
00:25:33.009 --> 00:25:35.790
- I was hoping you can help me.
- Yes.

173
00:25:35.815 --> 00:25:39.407
- Well, I'm looking for a teacher to train me for the...
