196
00:27:08.080 --> 00:27:10.144
And if you can't?

197
00:27:10.462 --> 00:27:12.394
Um.
Um...

198
00:27:14.626 --> 00:27:20.608
Right, how about an invitation to the Kumite anyway.
No strings attached.

199
00:27:21.080 --> 00:27:26.841
