and can not do.

218
00:30:08.720 --> 00:30:11.508
The woman who wins the Kumite
will sound louder than that.

219
00:30:11.533 --> 00:30:14.015
If I hit it like really hit it,
I'm going to break my hand.

220
00:30:14.040 --> 00:30:16.973
